# pwsbridge rules

- Keep SI inside the process; convert only in `internal/units`.
- Reply `success\n` only after accept. Sink and fanout errors never change the station body.
- Never log `PASSWORD`, `PASSKEY`, or `key`.
- Ecowitt PASSKEY matches station `password` by default; optional `passkey` overrides.
- Cloud fanout must use the injected public resolver; never `net.DefaultResolver` or `net.LookupIP`.
- New ingress protocol → new package under `internal/ingress/`.
- New output → new `Sink`; do not edit ingress.
- Soft cap ~200 lines per file. Document exported functions (purpose, inputs, outputs).
- Env (`PWSBRIDGE_*`) for one station. YAML only with `PWSBRIDGE_CONFIG`.
- Derived metrics off by default; per-tenant opt-in.
- Origin bugs need named negative tests from the plan before the fix counts as done.
- Prefer `docker compose` for build/test when Docker is available.
